  "generated_text": "First, observe that the product \\( \\prod_{k=0}^{n-1} \\left( \\left( 1 + e^{2 \\pi i k / n} \\right)^n + 1 \\right) \\) is equal to zero if and only if at of the the product the zero.\n\nNext, note that \\( \\left( 1 + e^{2 \\pi i k / n} \\right)^n + 1 \\) 0 \\) if and only if \\( \\left( 1 + e^{2 \\pi i k / n} \\right)^n = -1 \\).\n\nThis implies that \\( \\left( 1 + e^{2 \\pi i k / n} \\right)^n = -1 \\) if and only if \\( 1 + e^{2 \\pi i k / n} = -1 \\),\n\n \\( \\( \\( \\( \\ \\ \\ \\ n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n n",
